{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415670","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415670","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041567001:1":{"text":"이런 장소가 있을 줄이야.","source_cn":"没想到这里还有这样的好地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34A1793AD3687F53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567002:1":{"text":"나쁘지 않죠? 제가 직접 관리하고 있어요. 명절이 되면 장식도 바꾸고, 한정 메뉴도 내놓는답니다!","source_cn":"还不错吧？平时都是我亲手打理，节日的时候也会替换装饰，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A1B2D6ED56326D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567003:1":{"text":"아, 뭐 좀 마시겠어요? 어떤 취향이든 맞춰드릴 수 있어요!","source_cn":"对了，你要喝点什么吗？无论什么口味我都能做出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC55E8302FA6101A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567004:1":{"text":"그럼 부탁할게. 추천할 만한 건?","source_cn":"当然了，我很想试试，你有什么推荐的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15E2FB588A1D60CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567005:1":{"text":"어떤 맛을 좋아하세요?","source_cn":"你喜欢怎样的口味？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68A1BCD5861D1182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041567006:1":{"text":"음... 특별한 것? 처음 왔으니까 여러가지 맛을 느껴보고 싶어.","source_cn":"嗯……有特色的吧？因为我第一次来，还是想多了解各种风味。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CDA140A9B24F583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041567007:1":{"text":"그렇다면 이 스페셜 음료부터 드셔보세요!","source_cn":"那么，先试试这种特饮吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E45B8074D739444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041567008:1":{"text":"땅거미 숲의 베리들을 섞은 거예요. 정말 맛있답니다!","source_cn":"用了来自薄暮丛林的多种浆果混合，风味绝佳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAACD060A8716AF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041567009:1":{"text":"정말 예쁜 보라색이네. 마치 해질 무렵의 석양으로 물든 밤하늘 같아.","source_cn":"真是美丽的紫色，像是傍晚夕阳将落时的夜幕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF550CA194120A20D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041567010:1":{"text":"맛도 좋네. 입안에서 부드러운 단맛과 상큼함이 퍼지는데, 향기는 또 굉장히 짙구나.","source_cn":"味道也相当绝妙，口味如此甜美而清新，可是香气却又如此浓醇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3131807A878877C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041567011:1":{"text":"왜 이렇게 많은 사람들이 찾아오는 지 알겠어.","source_cn":"怪不得会有这么多人都会受邀来到这个地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC6EB9199CD2A1C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041567012:1":{"text":"이런 음료를 마실 수 있다면 내 친구들도 먼 곳에서 찾아올 거야.","source_cn":"我想，就凭这杯，我那些朋友们也会不远万里地过来品尝的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ABD3BFF106AD294","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041567013:1":{"text":"그럼 정말 좋겠네요. 미스테리 하우스가 더 북적북적해지겠어요!","source_cn":"那就太好了，神秘屋很快就能变得更热闹了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FF72A902D7D45E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:潘多拉":{"text":"판도라","source":"潘多拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:多莉":{"text":"돌리","source":"多莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}